    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/dd5fd9061e51594520cfb77f172474ec.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=151 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/5d34963099e76c36b2e7b24dd43635c1.poster.avif?t=1747712137\" width=568 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/5d34963099e76c36b2e7b24dd43635c1.webm?t=1747712137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/5d34963099e76c36b2e7b24dd43635c1.mp4?t=1747712137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bRandom Summons, Evolve into Legends!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon up to six elemental spirits randomly to fight alongside you! Each spirit race possesses unique elemental abilities that can be synthesized and evolved. You might even summon legendary spirits\u2014boasting unparalleled stats and explosive ultimate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/12b6912fc4bb2a5fd79c24d460fbc14f.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLuck or Strategy?\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both summoning and synthesis are randomized. Test your luck with a single pull to obtain high-tier spirits, or progress strategically to strengthen your roster. Every choice, driven by fortune or foresight, shapes the path to victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/e6e7888f7b4169010d949bc50f216e40.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Skins, Fresh Experiences!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock themed skins as you battle, each with distinct visuals and passive talents to enhance combat. Skins also feature unique progression paths and synergies with specific spirits. Master their combinations to unleash unexpected power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/63d87c4140bb686f17ad5f22460d6a58.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/5d34963099e76c36b2e7b24dd43635c1.poster.avif?t=1747712137\" width=568 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/5d34963099e76c36b2e7b24dd43635c1.webm?t=1747712137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/5d34963099e76c36b2e7b24dd43635c1.mp4?t=1747712137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bRandom Summons, Evolve into Legends!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon up to six elemental spirits randomly to fight alongside you! Each spirit race possesses unique elemental abilities that can be synthesized and evolved. You might even summon legendary spirits\u2014boasting unparalleled stats and explosive ultimate skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/12b6912fc4bb2a5fd79c24d460fbc14f.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bLuck or Strategy?\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both summoning and synthesis are randomized. Test your luck with a single pull to obtain high-tier spirits, or progress strategically to strengthen your roster. Every choice, driven by fortune or foresight, shapes the path to victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/e6e7888f7b4169010d949bc50f216e40.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bDiverse Skins, Fresh Experiences!\u200b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock themed skins as you battle, each with distinct visuals and passive talents to enhance combat. Skins also feature unique progression paths and synergies with specific spirits. Master their combinations to unleash unexpected power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473400/extras/63d87c4140bb686f17ad5f22460d6a58.avif?t=1747712137\" data-has-big width=800 height=244 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "\u300aSpirits &amp; Alice\u300bis a survivor game with Roguelite elements. You can summon elves, randomly synthesize rare elves, match hundreds of secret treasures, unlock hidden skills, repel the surging dark creatures, and help Alice find the way back to reality.",
